---
import CoordinateMark from "../components/CoordinateMark.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL GEOGRAPHIC ARCHIVE · 001</p>
    <h1>Atlas</h1>
    <p class="lede">记录地点、旅程，以及时间在坐标上留下的痕迹。</p>
    <CoordinateMark latitude="31.2304° N" longitude="121.4737° E" />
  </section>
  <section class="status-panel" aria-labelledby="status-heading">
    <p class="section-number">00 / FOUNDATION</p>
    <h2 id="status-heading">档案正在建立</h2>
    <p>应用骨架已就位。地点、旅程与时间轴将在后续步骤中逐步开放。</p>
    <a href="/system/database/">检查本地数据库 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
